{"name": "The Shadow Beneath", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/bb85477ca229537eb202d38440307f04.poster.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/bb85477ca229537eb202d38440307f04.webm?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/bb85477ca229537eb202d38440307f04.mp4?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue Akhenaten, the banished pharaoh, from an eternity beneath the sands. Wield the gifts of Aten's last disciples, unleash sacred techniques and battle the relentless guardians of the forgotten tombs in a fast-paced Action Roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/cc720d688106f60432f0dc3379c25621.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"432\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the scorching desert and descend into the cursed pyramids of Ancient Egypt. Battle undead mummies, venomous scorpions and the forgotten servants of the gods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/0142f10aec7b2c1ea35da2dc61dceca9.poster.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/0142f10aec7b2c1ea35da2dc61dceca9.webm?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/0142f10aec7b2c1ea35da2dc61dceca9.mp4?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/b9d3a79dc622b903808827d5c17b7e87.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"422\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the wisdom of Aten's last disciples, master sacred techniques and forge your own fighting style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/d5d7b976e27da189be7b4dfa5cfe87ee.poster.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/d5d7b976e27da189be7b4dfa5cfe87ee.webm?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/d5d7b976e27da189be7b4dfa5cfe87ee.mp4?t=1787300901\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"97\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/0af59ad90221c7d17679a6808d25265b.avif?t=1787300901\" width=\"379\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every chamber is a deadly trial, every guardian a formidable foe. Survive deadly traps, shatter your enemies and defy the will of the gods - or perish trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/04614aa22bb1b0301c97549499468